# Settings for the module the Bazel Central Registry presubmit runs.

# Keep no lockfile. The presubmit resolves this module under several Bazel
# versions, and a lockfile written by one of them fails under another. The
# other two roots in this repository do the opposite, pinning a lockfile with
# --lockfile_mode=error, because each checks one configuration.
#
# Without this, Bazel's default of --lockfile_mode=update writes one here, and
# that is how a 700-line lockfile reached the repository in `fef0398`.
common --lockfile_mode=off
